                "title": "4 Foot Long Stainless Steel Door Pull,  First Impressions Model #10/48-US32D",
                "description": "4 feet (48 inches) long, the Model PNR02048 large stainless steel door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as commercial office entry doors, store front doors, large appliance doors--just about anywhere a large door pull is desired. Choose from Polished or Brushed Stainless Steel finishes. Also Available: Lithonia, Matte Black, and Duro Bronze finishes. The 4 Foot Stainless Steel Pioneer Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass or metal doors. \r\n",
